## Honest gaps

# What is not done yet

<div class="cols">
<div>

### Engineering
- Mutation testing is configured but not yet a scheduled CI job
- Coverage floor (55% statements) sits well below the 90% target
- `/api/sync` needs authorisation (tier F)
- Branch protection: make `CI success` the required check
- Architecture cycles remain, held by a shrink-only baseline (#228)
- No Kubernetes deploy workflow yet, so the production tag is set by hand

</div>
<div>

### People, product and operations
- Human review is thin: **10 reviews** on 172 merged PRs, 8 from bots
- Every release so far was cut by one maintainer; the runbook is untested by the other
- Quay repositories and robot account need creating
- Presence never removes a departed student
- An empty whitelist admits any signed-in user
- Learning-record duration increments on page load as well as the 30s tick
- 53 open issues and 10 open PRs; Live stats phase 6 deferred

</div>
</div>

<span class="muted small">Status as recorded 17 to 21 September; some items may have moved since. The point of the ratchets is that this list is written down and can only get shorter.</span>

